ons","messageBody":"Several assumptions in the code are never stated: task-list indices are checked by the caller before get/delete, list capacity is positive, and a Task always has a non-blank description. A future change could break one without a test noticing, since the validation lives elsewhere. Add assert statements at these points to fail fast if an assumption is violated. User input is still validated with SummerException; assertions cover only what should be impossible.\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":39,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"c9fa31ccaf7abdc1a5c0c3b938a12753666e1ee2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Validate task number arguments","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":18,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"f9cf0077b33eeef0f0c2a235a7381cdb0371a820","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use streams to build the loaded task list","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":9,"deletions":13}}},{"hash":"a049d2c5387fa717860edfd4620c3751d4bf14b6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from v1-nce/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Add A-Assertions increment","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"f627b0655a0ab1334eed36fc269e201735f88f56","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"061d808ed9b0dd0ccce65572f3d3854aa7b3cbf9","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"1b4abd99e37e9b3dc006ef527180996dc82c7583","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from v1-nce/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Add A-CodeQuality increment","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"458a07792aa37afd0d038b42b65cdf646b4c92b1","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge br